List the project's generation jobs.

Usage
  azd ai eval job list [flags]

Flags
      --after string            : Resume after this id, which the previous page printed.
      --all                     : Retrieve every page. Overrides --limit.
      --dataset                 : Required (or --evaluator). Act on dataset generation jobs.
      --evaluator               : Required (or --dataset). Act on evaluator generation jobs.
      --limit int               : Rows per page. Defaults to 20.
      --project-endpoint string : Foundry project endpoint.

Global Flags
  -C, --cwd string         : Sets the current working directory
      --debug              : Enables debug and diagnostics logging
  -e, --environment string : The name of the environment to use
  -h, --help               : help for list
      --no-prompt          : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.
  -o, --output string      : The output format (default "default")

Examples
  List evaluator generation jobs
    azd ai eval job list --evaluator
